## Interface: 120100, 120105
## Title: XayaUI Dev Assist
## Notes: Developer and debugging tool for XayaUI (formerly XayaUI Game Data Capture / XayaUI_GameDump). Pulls every class, spec, talent, spell description, spellbook entry, gear and set-bonus line the game will give an addon, and records which auras each cast causes (with observed durations). Developer captures: a full inventory of the game's API in this client, live checks for the Character Toolkit, a catalogue of every aura current content points to, an aura log, and an event probe (/xuidev probe) that records what the game lets an addon read in combat. Opens from XayaUI > Settings > Debugging or with /xuidev (/xuidump still works).
## Author: Xaya
## Group: XayaUI
